# Line endings are decided here rather than by each contributor's
# `core.autocrlf`. Every file in this repository is currently LF in the index,
# but that holds because one Windows machine happens to have autocrlf on, which
# is a local setting and not a property of the repository. Without this file the
# first contributor whose git does not normalise turns a one-line edit to the
# profile page into a diff of the whole file.
*  text=auto
